tion\": \"It is essential that every employee understands the company's new policies.\",\n      \"options\": [\"Every employee must understand the company's new policies.\", \"It is necessary for every employee to understand the company's new policies.\", \"The employees need to know the company's new policies.\", \"That every employee understands the company's new policies is crucial.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"That every employee understands the company's new policies is crucial.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 35,\n      \"question\": \"By the time I arrived, they had already eaten dinner.\",\n      \"options\": [\"When I arrived, they had not yet eaten dinner.\", \"I arrived just in time to see them eating their dinner.\", \"It was only after I arrived that they ate dinner.\", \"They had finished eating dinner before I arrived.\"],\n      \"answer\": \"When I arrived, they had not yet eaten dinner.\"\n  ]\n}",
